To define a reliable ground truth, we adopt prime implicants and define our ground truth explanation to be the union of all prime implicants, for which we developed an exact, efficient extraction algorithm.
Finally, we proposed 
𝖦𝗋𝖺𝖼𝗋𝖡𝖾𝗇𝖼𝗁
\mathsf{Gracr}\mathsf{Bench}
, which evaluates graph explainers over compiled GNNs based on how well they recover the respective ground truth explanation (
