8.6 Establishing the access model
We establish the three primitives in Definition 10. First we compileW, then use it for number
measurement and joint evolution, and finally prepare the Gibbs state by standard filtering from an
easily prepared reference state.
Lemma 57(Coherent gapped phase classification).LetU be a unitary with uniform circuits for
controlledU and controlledU†. LetA be a fixed finite union of intervals on the unit circle, with
efficiently computable endpoints. Suppose every eigenphase ofU is at angular distance at least∆> 0
from any boundary ofA. For every0 < η <1/10, there is a uniform circuitFA,η such that, on
every eigenvectorU|ψ θ⟩= e iθ|ψθ⟩,
