AI tools based on large language models (LLMs) were used by the authors to assist with proofreading and structural suggestions. All recommendations generated by these tools were carefully reviewed and approved by the authors.








DISCLOSURE STATEMENT




The authors are not aware of any affiliations, memberships, funding, or financial holdings that might be perceived as affecting the objectivity of this review.",cues
