, and similar setups could be used to validate our framework on physical hardware. In parallel, real-world rewards can often be estimated directly from sensor data without explicit instrumentation: for example, lane deviation in a driving task can be inferred from a camera image. Demonstrating the framework on a physical robotic platform, either with directly measured or estimated rewards, would substantially strengthen its impact for the robotics community.








