2609.38552v1,Fairness Theatre: Evaluating Post-Hoc Fairness Interventions in Vendor-Controlled Early Warning Systems,"Once design is placed beyond the institution’s reach, the question stops being which fairness method performs best and becomes what fairness work is even possible, and for whom. The ASP-HEI cycle (Section 
2
