2609.36049v1,Improving scalable oversight with co-trained monitors,"Here, one way to satisfy this is for there to be a finite number of possible exploits for a given task. More precisely, we aim to characterize when it is possible to co-train the monitor so that both the error and query rate vanish asymptotically; we observe that this question corresponds to the 
