, an enterprise-focused CS-ASR benchmark of 1,212 linguistically validated utterances spanning five language pairs, and evaluated eight frontier ASR systems across three metrics. Our evaluation revealed a three-tier performance structure, with Scribe-v2, Gemini-3-Flash, and AssemblyAI consistently leading.






